'''Legendary Companions''' are the spirits of ancient [[ON:Nord|Nord]] [[ON:Companions (faction)|Companions]] that [[ON:Valdur|Valdur]] can allow you to take with you throughout [[ON:Honrich Tower|Honrich Tower]]. This Legendary Companion is a warrior who stood with the crew of the {{Lore Link|Kaal Kaaz}} in their final battle.

Notably, these followers will continue to accompany players far from the quest location, meaning you can even encounter them on the streets of [[ON:Riften|Riften]].
